{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e05-scene-03",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "总编室缺人手  (Short-Staffed in Hospital)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "kaiwen": "凯文"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Right after the Star Night broadcast wraps, Chun Yuqiao dismisses a complaining producer before acute stomach pain lands him in the hospital beside an equally exhausted Kaiwen. Listen to their Mandarin exchange with Xingzi first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "之后节目做完，不是还要见面吗？毕竟都是制作人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "制作人你配吗？一部的人为什么天天要加班？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我淳于乔是最没有人情味的，这儿用不了你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大，你怎么了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "乱子刚出，你就病了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大病得比我还重呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大的胃病确实越来越严重了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我求求老天赶快派个女人来照顾老大吧！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你不是说女人最可怕吗？忘了骆琳了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你不能来上班，总编室真的得找个人来顶。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "不然总编室忙不过来，星天真的会垮了。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "之后节目做完，不是还要见面吗？毕竟都是制作人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Once the show wraps up, will we not still meet again? After all, everyone is a producer.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "制作人你配吗？一部的人为什么天天要加班？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you deserve to be called a producer? Why does Unit One work overtime every single day?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我淳于乔是最没有人情味的，这儿用不了你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I, Chun Yuqiao, have zero time for personal favours; we have no use for you here.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大，你怎么了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Boss, what is wrong with you?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "乱子刚出，你就病了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Trouble just broke out, and you fell ill.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大病得比我还重呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Boss, your illness is even worse than mine.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大的胃病确实越来越严重了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The boss's stomach trouble has indeed grown worse and worse.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我求求老天赶快派个女人来照顾老大吧！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am begging heaven to hurry and send a woman to look after our boss!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你不是说女人最可怕吗？忘了骆琳了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Did you not say women are the scariest? Have you forgotten Luo Lin?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你不能来上班，总编室真的得找个人来顶。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Since you cannot come in to work, the chief editor's office really must find someone to cover.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "不然总编室忙不过来，星天真的会垮了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Otherwise the office cannot keep up, and Xingtian really will collapse.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "之后节目做完，不是还要见面吗？毕竟都是制作人。",
      "gap": 0.5
